  "description": "NetMetric.SystemIO is a cross-platform module for collecting process and system-level I/O throughput metrics in .NET.\n\t\t\tIt supports Linux, Windows, and macOS, and provides collectors for tracking read/write performance over time.\n\t\t\tThis package integrates with NetMetric's observability framework and supports dependency injection.",
